  <para style="h">Udiana Ñwed Pita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Udiana Ñwed Pita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Udiana Ñwed Pita</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Pita</para>
  <para style="mt1">Udiana Ñwed Pita</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ekọọm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Saimọn Pita, isʌñutom ye abọsịd Yisọs Krais, awet ñwed ami anọ esọk mbon e-ekebọọhọ nsọñudua mbuọdidem nte ake ñnyịn, ke adinenido Abasi ñnyịn ye Andinyaaña Yisọs Krais. <verse eid="2PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Mfọn ye emem akpọmiọk-akpọmiọk ato ke edidiọọñọ Abasi ye Yisọs Abọọñ ñnyịn aba ye ndufo.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adikọd ke Mbuọdidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Adudu Abasi inọ ñnyịn afịd se ñnyịn iyem nọ idu uwem ye uteeñe Abasi, ato adidiọọñọ anye, a-akedatta ubọọñ ye eti ido amọ ikoot ñnyịn. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Ato ke mme ñkpọ ami anye i-inọ ñnyịn mme nsọñudua enwọñọ amọ nọ ato do ndufo ewuana ke uduud Abasi, enyʌñ ebọkkọ mbiara asịneke ke ederimbod a-atooho mme ndiọi iwʌd.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Ke ntoro, idomo afịd ukeme adidian nti ido ke mbuọdidem ndufo; idian ifiọk ke nti ido; <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />inyʌñ idian mfadidem ke ifiọk. Idian ime ñko ke mfadidem; inyʌñ idian uteeñe abasi ke ime. <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />Idian ndukoppo ke uteeñe abasi, inyʌñ idian ima ke ndukoppo. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Sia adieke mme ñkpọ ami ebaaha ke esịd ndufo ayọhọ-ayọhọ, ammọ eyaenam ndufo ibaaha ibe-ibe, inyʌññọ inana mfịd ke adidiọọñọ Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ado awo i-imiinieghe mme ñkpọ ami ado nnan, itʌmmọ ikịt usʌñ, anyʌñ afre ke emaeyet mme ñkaan ndiọiñkpọ efep enyʌñ enam imọ isana.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Ke ntoro, nditọeka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke usem Greek adelfọi a-awuọñọke </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nditọeka </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ideen ye ibaan</char><char style="ft" closed="false">anyʌñ asʌk ada anọ ideen ye ibaan e-enịmme Krais ke akpanikọ ke atu ubon Abasi.</char></note> ke Krais, idọọdiọñ isịn ifịk inam ikood e-ekikoodo ndufo ye adimek e-ekimekke ndufo esọọñọ ada; sia adieke ndufo enamma mme ñkpọ ami, ndufo idiikọbọke iduọ. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Ndin eyaibọ ndufo esịn ke nsi-nsi abioubọọñ Abọọñ Andinyaaña ñnyịn Yisọs Krais.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Utịñanyen Nse Ikọ Abasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Ke ntoro ami ndiisʌk itotoiyo ndufo mme ñkpọ ami afịd ini, akpesʌkado a-ndufo ediọọñọke ammọ enyʌñ esọọñọ eda ke akpanikọ a-ndufo enieghe idahami. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Ami ñkere ke a-anen adidemme akikere ndufo ke aditoiyo ndufo ñkpọ ami, adaña nte ami mbaaha ke abʌkidem, <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />sia ami mmediọọñọ ke ñyaasọp mfʌt abʌkidem ami nnịm ñkañ keed naña Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais akeyaara añwọt miin. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Ndin ami ñyaasịn ifịk aditoiyo ndufo mbaak mmaadakka ndufo etoiyo mme ñkpọ ami afịd ini.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Sia ñnyịn ikikeeneke ñkaña mbʌk a-awo adatta mbufiọk atịppe, ke ini ñnyịn ikinamma ndufo ediọọñọ adudu ye adidi Abọọñ ñnyịn Yisọs Krais, ado ñnyịn ke idem ñnyịn ikidat anyen ñnyịn ikịt ubọọñ amọ. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Anye amaabọ ukpono ye ubọọñ ke ubọk Abasi Ete, ke ini uyio aketooho ke Akaakan Ubọọñ ado asịm anye ntom, ate, “Anye ami ado Ayịn mmi, a-ami mmaaha; esịd anekke annem miin abaña anye.” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Ñnyịn ke idem ñnyịn imaikop uyio ado naña ato hefịn awuọ ke ini ñnyịn ikibaaha ye anye ke adisana abod ado.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Emaesọọñọ ikọ mme prọfed ñnyịn, ndin ana ndufo etʌm ekpañ utọñ, nte awo ase utuenikañ a-ayammake ke ekịm, tutu ayio asiere, ndin ntantaafiọñ ubakusen anyʌñ asakka ke esịd ndufo. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Akpan-akpan, ana ndufo ediọọñọ ke ibaaha brọfesi ndomokeed ke ñwed Abasi a-prọfed ndomokeed akedatta ifiọk amọ akappa. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Sia kpaanam brọfesi ndomokeed itooho uduak awo, ado mme prọfed etañ ikọ a-atooho Abasi, naña Adisana Sịbidịd adat ammọ usʌñ abo etañ.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nsobo mme Nsu-nsu Andikpeeb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Ado mme prọfed abiaña emaebiọññọ ke ufọọd mbon awo kpa naña mme andikpeeb abiaña ediinyʌñ iba ke ufọọd ndufo. Ammọ eyaedịbe edat asen ukpeebñkpọ nsobo edi, enyʌñ ekañ Abọọñ andikara a-akedeppe ammọ, ndin edat usọp-usọp nsobo enọ idem ammọ. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Uwak awo eyaenyʌñ ekeene usʌñ abʌkidem ammọ, ndin ato ammọ, mme awo eyaetañ idiọọk ikọ edian usʌñ akpanikọ. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Ke idiọọk itọñ ammọ mme andikpeeb abiaña ami eyaenam udod eto mbʌk a-ammọ enamma ke idem ammọ. Tọọñọ ke esed ubiomikpe amaadodoro ammọ ke iwuod, ndin nsobo ammọ inyʌññọ ikpeene.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Sia adieke Abasi imiikiyakka mme enyere e-ekedueghe ebọkkọ, ado atop ammọ aduọọk ke itie ufen ikañ, anyʌñ asịn ammọ ke ñkịm-ñkịm ukpe, ate enịm ammọ do tutu ubiideikpe; <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />adieke anye imiikinyʌññọ iyak akaan ederimbod abọkkọ, ado adat mmọọñ ukwọ asobo mbon i-imiikikponoke Abasi, ndin akpeme Nua, akwọrọ adinenido ye awo itiaba mfen; <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />adieke anye akesuaha anọ Sọdọm ye Komora ke adifọp ammọ nọ ekappa ntọñ, anyʌñ adat ammọ anam uwọdñkpọ anọ mbon i-imiidiọọñọke Abasi; <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />ñko, adieke anye akenyaañake Lọọd, adinen awo, a-akefʌhọke abaña abʌd-abʌd ido mbon i-imiinịmme mbed <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />(sia naña adinen awo ado akedʌñ ke atu ammọ, se anye akekịt anyʌñ akop akenam eti esịd amọ akịt mfʌhọ ke usen ke usen ye atịme-atịme adinam ammọ). <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Adieke adooho ntoro, Abọọñ adiọọñọ naña adiinyaaña mbon e-ekponoke anye, asio ammọ ke idomo, ado anịm mme idiọọk awo ke itie ufen tutu asịm usen ikpe; <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />akpan-akpan mbon e-eduuho uwem ekeene idiọọk itọñ abʌkidem enyʌñ emiom mme akama ukara.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Ammọ edoñño mbon usanya anyen ye mbon ntañidem, ndin ndịk inamma ammọ adisueeñ mme adudu anyọñ; <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />ado mme enyere akpesʌkado e-ekoppo idem enyʌñ enie udịd ekan ammọ, itañña ikọ nsueñ ye utọ ibon ado ke emaeben edi ikpe ke iso Abọọñ. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Ado mbon ami etañ ikọ nsuukuyio ebaña mme ñkpọ se imiinwañake ammọ. Ammọ eba nte mme unam i-imiinieghe akikere, mme unam e-enamma ñkpọ naña ekịt, e-emanake ke uduod unam nọ emʌm ammọ ewot; ndin nte mme unam i-imiikereke ñkpọ, ammọ ñko eyaetak.<verse eid="2PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Eyaenọ ammọ utịb idiọọk akeene idiọọk a-ammọ enamma. Se ammọ edat nte udia uwem ado ammọ adidu abʌd-abʌd uwem ke ufọọd uweemeayio iba. Ammọ edoñño ñkpọ abuud ye asuenne, ke ini adooho ammọ esʌk ekop inem adidu abʌd-abʌd uwem ado esʌk ekeene ewana ke usọrọ ye ndufo. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Afịd akikere ammọ ayọhọ ye efịbe, inyʌññọ itre adinam idiọọkñkpọ. Ammọ etap mbon i-imiinieghe iwuuk; edoñño mbon akpọsọñ idiọọk itọñ ye mbon isuuñọ! <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Ammọ ekpọñ nnen-nnen usʌñ enyʌñ ewọññọ ekeene usʌñ Balaam ayịn Besa, a-akemaaha utịb ibak: <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Ado dọñki amaasua idiọọk ido amọ anọ anye, unam i-imiikanna ikọ itañ, amaatañ ikọ ke uyio awo, anyʌñ anam idaad prọfed ado atre.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Mbon ami edoñño idịm i-imiisakkake mmọọñ ye ntuhube ayobio abenne afịme aboiyo. Ataa abubịd ekịm ke enịm enọ ammọ. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Sia ammọ etañ ikpu-ikpu ikọ ñkpooninua enyʌñ edat adukpo ido a-asañake ye idiọọk itọñ abʌkidem etap mbon e-ebọkkọke mbon e-ebaaha ke ndudue. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Ammọ enwọñọ adinọ ammọ uwuọufʌn, ke ini adooho ammọ ke idem ammọ edoñño ifʌn abʌd-abʌd ido ammọ, sia awo adʌk afʌn anọ ñkpọ se ikara anye. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Sia adieke ammọ emaekebọkkọ mbiara ederimbod ami ke adidiọọñọ Abọọñ ye Andinyaaña ñnyịn Yisọs Krais ndin emaana ekesịn idem ke ñkpọ se isappa awo, enyʌñ eyaak ñkpọ ado akan ammọ ubọk, utịd ammọ ayaadiọọk akan akpa. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Akpaakefọn ammọ adikpitre adikidiọọñọ usʌñ adinenido akan adidiọọñọ, ndin ewọññọ ekpọñ adisana ewʌhọ e-ekenọọhọ ammọ. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Mme ñke ami edo akpanikọ ke uwem ammọ: “Ewa atịmme abịne akikọi amọ,” ñko, “Edi e-eyette idem amaana akaa akewere ke mbad.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Usen Abọọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Mme ndima ufan, ami ado ayọhọ ñwedetob iba a-ami nnọọhọ isọk ndufo. Ñwet naña ñwed iba ami aditoiyo ndufo adinie eti akikere. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Ami ñyem ndufo etoiyo mme ikọ a-mme ndisana prọfed eketañña ke anyan ini a-akeboiyoke ye ewʌhọ A-Abọọñ ye Andinyaaña ñnyịn akinọọhọ ato mme abọsịd ndufo.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Ke akanna ado, ana ediọọñọ ke mme anọọ awo ñyọọ eyaedi ke mme akpatre usen, enọ ñyọọ enyʌñ ekeene mme ndiọi udọñ ammọ. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Ammọ eyaebo, “Mmọ ‘aditịmme ndi’ a-anye akenwọñọke? Sia tọọñọ mme ete ñnyịn ekekpañña, afịd ñkpọ asʌk aba naña akeba tọọñọ ke ntọọñọ ederimbod.” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Ado ammọ efọfiọk efre ebo ke anyan ini, ato ke ikọ Abasi hefịn amaaba ye isọñ e-ekenamma eto mmọọñ enyʌñ edat mmọọñ ebot. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Mmọọñ ami ñko ke ekedat efʌk enyʌñ esobo ederimbod a-akebaaha idahado. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Ato kpasʌk ke ikọ ado e-enịm mme hefịn ye isọñ e-ebaaha idahami enọ ikañ, sia enịm enọ usen ikpe ye adisobo mbon i-imiidiọọñọke Abasi.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ado ikiifre ñkpọ keed ami, mme ndima ufan, usen keed ke anyen Abọọñ aba nte tọsịn isua, tọsịn isua anyʌñ aba nte usen keed. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Abọọñ iyeete ke adinam enwọñọ amọ, naña mme awo ekere ke anye a-ayeet. Anye akap anie anyanime ye ndufo, inyʌññọ iyem awo ndomokeed atak, ado ayem afịd awo etua ñkpọfiọk enyʌñ ekappa esịd.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Ado usen Abọọñ adiidi adiwat nte inọ. Mme hefịn eyaeboiyo efep ye ekamba uyom; ikañ ayaasobo se ekedat ebot ederimbod, ndin isọñ ye afịd ñkpọ ke esịd adiina ukpọk.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Sia ediisobo afịd ñkpọ ntom, nsoo utọ awo ke akpenaa ndufo edo? Akpena ndufo edu adisana uwem ye uwem ke uteeñe Abasi <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />naña ndufo etieghe ebet usen Abasi enyʌñ eyem asọsọp adi. Usen ado ke ediisobo mme hefịn ke ikañ, ñko se edat ebot ederimbod ayaatara ke akpọsọñ ufiob ado. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Ato ke se anye akenwọñọ ñnyịn idot anyen inyʌñ itie ibet ufa hefịn ye ufa isọñ, idʌñ adinenido.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Ke ntoro, mme ndima ufan, sia ndufo etieghe ebet mme ñkpọ ami, isịn afịd ifịk nọ ikịt ndufo naña enana ntọi, enana ndo enyʌñ eba ke emem ye anye. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Inyʌñ idiọọñọ ke anyanime Abọọñ ñnyịn awuọ adinyaaña, kpa naña Pọọl, ataa adima ayịneka ñnyịn ke Krais adat ifiọk A-Abasi akenọọhọ anye awet anọ isọk ndufo. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Anye awet afịd ñwedetob amọ ke usʌñ keed, atañ abaña mme ñkpọ ami. Mme ñwedetob amọ a-adọñọ mme ñkpọ i-imiisọọpọ inwaña awo, ndin mbon ndisịme ye mbon i-imiinieghe iwuuk eyʌttọ se ewet enịm, kpa naña ammọ enam ye ikọ Abasi mfen, ndin edat nsobo esọk idem ammọ.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Ke ntoro, mme ndima ufan, sia emaekidọdʌt ndufo utọñ ebaaña ñkpọ ami, ikpeme mbaak mme abiad mbed ediben ndufo etịn usʌñ enyʌñ enam ndufo eduọọk nsọọñọnda ndufo. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Ado ikọt ke mfọn ye ifiọk Abọọñ ye Andinyaaña ñnyịn Yisọs Krais.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2PE 3:18" />
  <para style="b" vid="2PE 3:18" />
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 3:18">Yak ubọọñ anie anye ke ami ye ke nsi-nsi, Amen.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>